title: Polish Red Autumn events

@candidate
title: Who speaks for the returned Left?
new-page: true
on-arrival: candidate_event_done = 1; news_headline = "The presidential nomination opens every old wound"

= November 2019 — Who speaks for the returned Left?

The presidential election is six months away. SLD controls much of the
organisation, Wiosna claims the obvious national candidate, and Razem refuses
to provide activists for a campaign whose programme it cannot enforce.

- @candidate_biedron
- @candidate_zandberg
- @candidate_primary

@candidate_biedron
title: Nominate Robert Biedroń early
subtitle: The recognisable and historical choice; Spring gains ownership.
on-arrival: presidential_candidate = "Robert Biedroń"; presidential_candidate_base = 2.2; spring_dissent -= 10; spring_strength += 4; media_capacity += 3; razem_dissent += 5; barons_dissent += 2; progressive_credibility += 2; news_headline = "Biedroń becomes the Left's presidential candidate"

Biedroń gives the alliance a modern, European and openly gay national figure.
Razem asks whether it has joined somebody else's campaign; regional SLD
officials ask who will control the lists after it.

- @poland_events_2021_2023.independence_2019: Face the first Independence Day test

@candidate_zandberg
title: Give Adrian Zandberg the campaign
subtitle: A material programme, at the price of SLD and Spring resistance.
on-arrival: presidential_candidate = "Adrian Zandberg"; presidential_candidate_base = 3.2; razem_dissent -= 12; razem_strength += 4; labor_credibility += 5; spring_dissent += 8; barons_dissent += 6; party_unity -= 2; news_headline = "Zandberg turns the election into a programme fight"

The campaign acquires a sharp position on housing, work and public services.
Biedroń's network does not intend to disappear politely, and SLD barons have
not forgotten who owns the legal vehicle.

- @poland_events_2021_2023.independence_2019: Face the first Independence Day test

@candidate_primary
title: Hold an open primary
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. Electorate, ballot rules and preparation determine the field.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources to organise a credible primary.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; primary_active = 1; presidential_candidate = "Undecided"; primary_winner = "Undecided"; news_headline = "The Left opens a presidential primary"
go-to: poland_primary.franchise

@budget_2019
title: The first budget vote
new-page: true
on-arrival: budget_2019_done = 1; annual_budget_year = 2019; next_budget_label = "December 2020"; budget = 0; budget_authority = "Opposition — no state spending authority"; opposition_budget_default = 1; news_headline = "The first budget forces a common opposition line"
go-to: poland_opposition_budget.start

= December 2019 — The first budget vote

PiS presents the budget for 2020. The Left cannot defeat it, but the vote will
define whether the new club acts as one opposition, bargains for material
changes or becomes a collection of amendments. Unless Lewica secures a specific
concession, its default position is to oppose the government budget.

- @budget_2019_shadow
- @budget_2019_deal
- @budget_2019_fragments

@budget_2019_shadow
title: Oppose the PiS budget with one costed Left alternative
subtitle: Cost: 1 party resource. Opposition proposal only; it cannot implement hospital, wage or housing spending.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough capacity to cost and defend a full package.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; opposition_budget_default = 1; budget_strategy = "Vote no with a common social alternative"; budget_2019_package = "Costed social opposition package"; budget_2019_package_code = 1; budget_promises += 2; health_policy_pressure += 3; household_policy_pressure += 3; labor_credibility += 5; media_capacity += 2; razem_dissent -= 5; barons_dissent += 2; last_policy_stage = "Proposal"; last_policy_authority = "Parliamentary opposition"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "The Left opposes the budget with one alternative"

Hospitals, public-sector wages, housing and labour enforcement appear in one
financed package. It cannot pass the Sejm, and it must still pass the five
currents claiming to own it.

- @budget_2019_ratification: Put the position to the caucuses

@budget_2019_deal
title: Win one welfare amendment and support the budget
subtitle: Negotiated concession, not implementation; it takes effect only when the budget completes Parliament.
on-arrival: opposition_budget_default = 0; government_favors += 1; budget_strategy = "Support after a selective welfare deal"; budget_2019_package = "Welfare amendment and PiS budget deal"; budget_2019_package_code = 2; budget_2019_concession_pending = 1; household_policy_pressure += 1; pis_relation += 8; ko_relation -= 7; razem_dissent += 9; progressives_dissent += 4; party_unity -= 3; last_policy_stage = "Negotiated concession"; last_policy_authority = "PiS cabinet and Sejm majority"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "A welfare amendment divides the Left"

The amendment has real beneficiaries. It also gives PiS the photograph and KO
the accusation that the Left can always be bought separately.

- @budget_2019_ratification: Put the deal to the caucuses

@budget_2019_fragments
title: Let every caucus submit its own amendments
subtitle: Everyone speaks; nobody owns a common alternative.
on-arrival: opposition_budget_default = 1; budget_strategy = "Five separate opposition lines"; budget_2019_package = "Five separate amendment packages"; budget_2019_package_code = 3; budget_breaches += 1; party_unity -= 7; barons_dissent -= 2; spring_dissent -= 2; labor_dissent -= 2; progressives_dissent -= 2; razem_dissent -= 2; public_trust -= 3; news_headline = "Five Left budgets reach the microphones"

Each faction obtains a clean clip and an unbroken red line. The public learns
that the alliance can describe five futures and finance none together.

- @budget_2019_ratification: Count the absence of a common position

@budget_2019_ratification
title: The first caucus ratification
new-page: true
call: poland_normalize
on-arrival: {!
const clampSupport2019 = function(value) {
    return Math.max(0, Math.min(100, value));
};
const commonBase2019 =
    43 + Q.party_unity * 0.36 -
    Math.max(0, Q.budget_promises) * 0.8 -
    Q.budget_breaches * 3;

let barons2019 =
    commonBase2019 - Math.max(0, Q.barons_dissent) * 0.65;
let spring2019 =
    commonBase2019 - Math.max(0, Q.spring_dissent) * 0.65;
let labor2019 =
    commonBase2019 - Math.max(0, Q.labor_dissent) * 0.65;
let progressives2019 =
    commonBase2019 - Math.max(0, Q.progressives_dissent) * 0.65;
let razem2019 =
    commonBase2019 - Math.max(0, Q.razem_dissent) * 0.65;
let pps2019 =
    commonBase2019 - Math.max(0, Q.pps_dissent) * 0.65;

if (Q.budget_2019_package_code == 1) {
    barons2019 += 2;
    spring2019 += 4;
    labor2019 += 12;
    progressives2019 += 7;
    razem2019 += 15;
    pps2019 += 12;
}
if (Q.budget_2019_package_code == 2) {
    barons2019 += 12;
    spring2019 -= 5;
    labor2019 += 4;
    progressives2019 -= 10;
    razem2019 -= 16;
    pps2019 += 2;
}
if (Q.budget_2019_package_code == 3) {
    barons2019 += 3;
    spring2019 += 3;
    progressives2019 += 2;
    pps2019 += 2;
}

barons2019 = clampSupport2019(barons2019);
spring2019 = clampSupport2019(spring2019);
labor2019 = clampSupport2019(labor2019);
progressives2019 = clampSupport2019(progressives2019);
razem2019 = clampSupport2019(razem2019);
pps2019 = clampSupport2019(pps2019);

const caucusVotes2019 = [
    ["barons", barons2019],
    ["spring", spring2019],
    ["labor", labor2019],
    ["progressives", progressives2019],
    ["razem", razem2019],
    ["pps", pps2019]
].filter(function(entry) {
    return Q[entry[0] + "_active"];
});
const totalStrength2019 = caucusVotes2019.reduce(function(total, entry) {
    return total + Q[entry[0] + "_strength"];
}, 0);
const weighted2019 = caucusVotes2019.reduce(function(total, entry) {
    return total + entry[1] * Q[entry[0] + "_strength"];
}, 0);

Q.budget_2019_backing =
    Math.max(
        0,
        Math.min(
            100,
            Math.round(weighted2019 / Math.max(1, totalStrength2019))
        )
    );
Q.budget_2019_vetoes = caucusVotes2019.filter(function(entry) {
    return entry[1] < 35;
}).length;
Q.budget_2019_ratified =
    Q.budget_2019_package_code != 3 &&
    Q.budget_2019_backing >= 55 &&
    Q.budget_2019_vetoes <= 1 ? 1 : 0;
Q.budget_2019_rebels =
    Q.budget_2019_ratified &&
    (Q.budget_2019_backing < 65 || Q.budget_2019_vetoes > 0) ? 1 : 0;

if (Q.budget_2019_ratified && !Q.budget_2019_rebels) {
    Q.party_unity += 5;
    Q.public_trust += 3;
    Q.news_headline = "The returned Left ratifies one opposition line";
} else if (Q.budget_2019_ratified) {
    Q.party_unity += 1;
    Q.public_trust += 1;
    Q.news_headline = "The opposition line passes with named rebels";
} else if (Q.budget_2019_backing >= 40) {
    Q.party_unity -= 5;
    Q.public_trust -= 2;
    Q.news_headline = "The first common fiscal position fails";
} else {
    Q.party_unity -= 9;
    Q.public_trust -= 4;
    Q.news_headline = "The first budget vote opens a factional rupture";
}
!}

= The first vote

**[+ budget_2019_package +] receives [+ budget_2019_backing +]% weighted caucus
backing.** Internal vetoes: **[+ budget_2019_vetoes +]**. This is authority for
a voting line, not access to the state treasury.

[? if budget_2019_ratified and not budget_2019_rebels: The parliamentary club
owns one fiscal position. The peace is real precisely because every current had
the power to refuse it. ?]

[? if budget_2019_ratified and budget_2019_rebels: The line passes narrowly.
Senior dissenters reserve the right to reopen it in the next crisis. ?]

[? if not budget_2019_ratified: The alliance reaches the microphones without a
ratified common budget. Every unresolved promise now follows it into 2020. ?]

- @poland_senate.budget_2019: Send the budget to the Senate

@media
title: A campaign without an ecosystem
new-page: true
on-arrival: media_event_done = 1; news_headline = "The Left discovers how little media it owns"

= January 2020 — A campaign without an ecosystem

Public television serves the governing party. Commercial news centres the duel
between PiS and KO. The Left has good individual guests but no daily operation
capable of turning local reporting into a consistent national message.

- @media_newsroom
- @media_subscription
- @media_personalities
- @media_wait

@media_newsroom
title: Fund a campaign newsroom and rapid-response team
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. Slow-looking, durable capacity.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; media_strategy = "Professional network"; media_relationship = "Owned newsroom and trained guest network"; media_capacity += 12; local_network += 3; public_trust += 2; news_headline = "A small newsroom begins to contest the first frame"

There is no grand launch—only researchers, producers, regional contacts and
training. The candidate stops learning the day's hostile question on air.

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

@media_subscription
title: Build the operation around subscriptions and a membership drive
subtitle: +1 resource and modest reach. Organisers spend the month asking the same supporters twice.
on-arrival: resources += 1; media_strategy = "Supporter subscription"; media_relationship = "Supporter-funded mailing and video operation"; media_capacity += 4; local_network += 2; organiser_energy -= 4; young_support += 1; barons_dissent += 2; news_headline = "Subscriptions finance a small Left media operation"

The appeal produces recurring donors and a usable mailing list, but not a
newsroom capable of answering every hostile broadcast.

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

@media_personalities
title: Put everything behind recognisable personalities
subtitle: Immediate reach; the organisation remains hollow.
on-arrival: media_strategy = "Leader-led campaign"; media_relationship = "Leader access without owned distribution"; media_capacity += 5; left_poll += 0.4; spring_strength += 2; barons_dissent += 3; public_trust -= 1; news_headline = "The candidate becomes the entire media strategy"

Bookings increase and every success belongs to the candidate. So does every
mistake. Local candidates wait for material that never arrives.

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

@media_wait
title: Save the money for the formal campaign
subtitle: Resources survive; hostile frames compound.
on-arrival: media_strategy = "Reactive"; media_relationship = "Reactive bookings and borrowed audiences"; media_capacity -= 2; left_poll -= 0.3; public_trust -= 2; news_headline = "The Left again answers yesterday's story"

The treasury is relieved. The press office is not.

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

