@merger
title: What is Nowa Lewica?
new-page: true
on-arrival: merger_event_done = 1; news_headline = "SLD and Wiosna negotiate the new party"

= September 2020 — What is Nowa Lewica?

SLD and Wiosna are ready to turn an electoral alliance into a common legal
party. Razem is not merging. The question is whether the new structure treats
that fact as autonomy, disloyalty or an invitation to renegotiate the whole
camp.

- @merger_dual
- @merger_central
- @merger_assets
- @merger_convention

@merger_dual
title: Protect SLD and Wiosna with dual leadership
subtitle: Historical architecture; peace today, postponed integration.
on-arrival: left_project = "Nowa Lewica with SLD–Wiosna parity"; party_unity += 5; barons_dissent -= 5; spring_dissent -= 7; progressives_dissent += 1; razem_cooperation += 2; news_headline = "Nowa Lewica begins with two protected halves"

Neither founder can immediately absorb the other. Every appointment now has
two owners and a future succession problem.

- @poland_hub: Open the new chapter

@merger_central
title: Centralise the new party around SLD machinery
subtitle: Efficient organisation; Spring and younger progressives lose trust.
on-arrival: left_project = "Centralised Nowa Lewica"; barons_strength += 7; barons_dissent -= 8; local_network += 4; spring_dissent += 12; progressives_dissent += 7; party_unity -= 5; news_headline = "The old machine writes the new rules"

The party can make decisions. A growing number of its most visible new faces
now wonder whether they joined or were acquired.

- @poland_hub: Open the new chapter

@merger_assets
title: Consolidate SLD offices, leases and campaign accounts first
subtitle: +2 resources and a stronger machine. Wiosna and Razem see an asset takeover.
on-arrival: resources += 2; left_project = "Asset-led Nowa Lewica"; local_network += 4; barons_strength += 4; barons_dissent -= 5; spring_dissent += 10; progressives_dissent += 6; razem_dissent += 5; party_unity -= 4; public_trust -= 1; news_headline = "The merger begins with the old party's balance sheet"

The new organisation inherits rooms, equipment and solvent regional accounts.
It also inherits an answer to the question of who owns the merger.

- @poland_hub: Open the new chapter

@merger_convention
title: Convene a broader Left constituent convention
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. Razem keeps legal autonomy but writes common rules.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources for a credible national process.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; left_project = "Federated Left convention"; razem_cooperation += 10; razem_dissent -= 6; party_unity += 7; barons_dissent += 9; spring_dissent += 2; media_capacity += 2; news_headline = "The alliance writes rules larger than one party"

The convention establishes common-list, primary and dispute procedures without
pretending Razem has dissolved. SLD regional leaders see an expensive machine
they no longer fully control.

- @poland_hub: Open the new chapter

@abortion
