= October 2020 — The Tribunal ruling

The Constitutional Tribunal, whose own composition is disputed, removes the
main legal ground used for abortion in Poland. Demonstrations spread despite
the pandemic. The Women's Strike is not a party auxiliary and does not intend
to become one.

- @abortion_logistics
- @abortion_lead
- @abortion_front
- @abortion_caution

@abortion_logistics
title: Supply lawyers, rooms and security without taking the stage
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. High movement trust and autonomy.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; abortion_strategy = "Autonomous movement support"; movement_origin_strategy = "Autonomous legal and safety network"; feminist_trust += 12; movement_autonomy += 8; organiser_energy += 8; progressive_credibility += 6; barons_dissent += 5; president_relation -= 4; news_headline = "The Left works behind a movement it does not own"

Party lawyers and local offices become useful infrastructure. Organisers decide
who speaks and what the strike demands.

- @poland_hub: Face the streets

@abortion_lead
title: Put party leaders at the head of the protest
subtitle: Immediate visibility, severe capture risk.
on-arrival: abortion_strategy = "Party-led mobilisation"; movement_origin_strategy = "Party-led mobilisation"; progressive_credibility += 8; media_capacity += 5; left_poll += 0.4; movement_autonomy -= 14; feminist_trust -= 5; barons_dissent += 7; news_headline = "Party flags fill a movement larger than the party"

The Left is impossible to ignore and easy to blame. Activists ask whether the
same leaders will remain when cameras leave.

- @poland_hub: Face the streets

@abortion_front
title: Build a broad parliamentary and civic front
subtitle: Slower message; strong democratic and legal coordination.
on-arrival: abortion_strategy = "Broad democratic front"; movement_origin_strategy = "Broad democratic front"; ko_relation += 5; feminist_trust += 6; judicial_legitimacy += 5; constitutional_restraint += 4; progressive_credibility += 4; party_unity += 1; news_headline = "The ruling meets a broad constitutional front"

The response links bodily autonomy with an unlawfully composed court. Some
movement radicals find the frame too institutional; cautious voters can enter
it.

- @poland_hub: Face the streets

@abortion_caution
title: Defend the old compromise and condemn escalation
subtitle: Old-guard calm, progressive breach.
on-arrival: abortion_strategy = "Defend the compromise"; movement_origin_strategy = "Defended the old compromise"; barons_dissent -= 7; president_relation += 3; psl_relation += 4; progressive_credibility -= 10; feminist_trust -= 14; progressives_dissent += 13; spring_dissent += 8; party_unity -= 5; news_headline = "The old guard asks the streets to go home"

The position once passed for moderation. In the new legal reality it sounds
like a defence of something the state has already abolished.

- @poland_hub: Face the streets

