= May 2021 — Recovery fund

The EU recovery fund has broad support, but the government lacks a secure
majority for the ratification law. Lewica can negotiate directly with PiS,
seek a common opposition position, or abstain and leave the majority to others.

- @recovery_deal
- @recovery_opposition
- @recovery_abstain
- @recovery_palace

